Chapter: ListPatternNested

 A nested pattern inside a Cons field is refused with CDX2088: the
 arm-chain desugar would have to duplicate the rest of the match per
 nesting level. The message says to bind the tail and match it in a
 nested when.

Section: Body

  second-of : List Integer -> Integer
  second-of (xs) =
   when xs
    is Cons (_) (Cons (_) (_)) -> 1
    is otherwise -> 0

  opening : Integer
  opening = second-of [1, 2, 3]
